{"seq":23,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-08-l2-tansley-parcel-site-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:45:43.026Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7fb5499472a0e6ff933c55a36727414ba6df43fc91bda63548d822e17e5b8539","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Tobias, here's what I found for the Tansley Parcel file:\n\n1. Depot site in the carrier API outage: Southgate. In #inc-tansley-carrier-api (3 Sep 2025), Pree reported label printing stalled at the Tansley Parcel depots, with Southgate dispatch stacking totes by door 4. The incident closed the same evening once labels were printing again and Southgate had cleared the backlog.\n\n2. Main contact for the yard jockey login problem at the Tulsa hub: Lev Arkadin. In #central-team on 2 Jul 2025, Pree said Lev had messaged her about it. I couldn't find a title or email for Lev, and there's no Tansley Parcel account folder in the shared files, so it's worth checking with Pree."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792245600.000126"}}
